{"repo":"mercadona/control-tower","epic":"\"9\"","issue":328,"plan":"docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-13-issue-328-the-coordinating-session.md","plan_sha256":"a57b0546735cdc18c85cd421db84a109aeecf8c9d5eaf6d291df812924c87502","task":5,"task_name":"The hooks in the checkout's local settings, purged before they are written","tasks_total":13,"step":"implement","attempt":1,"plugin_version":"0.57.0","actor":"jponzvan@mercadona.es","written_at":"2026-09-13T10:32:39.175Z","outcome":"done","paths":2,"why":null,"summary":"Added LocalSettingsSessionHooks, the SessionHooks adapter that merges the app's three hooks (UserPromptSubmit, Notification, Stop) into the checkout's .claude/settings.local.json: it purges entries whose command substring-matches CT_SESSION_HOOKS_URL (so a stale command with a different literal port still gets dropped, not just an exact-text match), drops a group left with no hooks, and leaves every foreign entry untouched. A missing file becomes {}; a file that fails JSON.parse, or parses to something that is not a JSON object, raises SessionHooksNotUnderstood before any write; a failing write is wrapped as SessionHooksNotWritten. All six named tests assert the literal written JSON (or the literal exception type) using hand-copied expected strings that never reference LocalSettingsSessionHooks.COMMAND/MARKER/TIMEOUT_SECONDS/EVENTS/SETTINGS, so a mutation to any of those constants turns the suite red; verified this with a hand mutation sweep (marker check, COMMAND text, path segments, both catch blocks, the empty-group-drop rule) - every mutation was killed, and the file was restored byte-identical afterward. Verification commands (typecheck, the new test file, and the grep for SessionStart) all pass; this task only wires the adapter and its unit test, not the composition root that would inject it, since that path is outside this task's Files: line.","brief_vara_ct_docs":8,"brief_bytes":54970,"agent_bytes":11986,"skill_bytes":18145,"package_bytes":54970,"tool":"claude-code","tool_version":"2.1.270","tool_usage_status":"measured","tool_input_tokens":12,"tool_cached_input_tokens":3242862,"tool_output_tokens":3967,"tool_total_tokens":3246841,"tool_duration_status":"unsupported","tool_active_duration_ms":null,"tool_usage_evidence":["req_011Cf1H5YNEvWheKDgKBmRya","req_011Cf1H6AUde288n7e9TGd8b","req_011Cf1H6oxt3uD4RgYNRLYmT","req_011Cf1H84AS7HEeQwQb68LoM","req_011Cf1H8ar9Pegyr56rPKyjW","req_011Cf1HZRifYPYnKV9RLeJyw"],"tool_usage_gaps":0}
